{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence.md","title":"Equivalence of Weak and Boolos Fixed Points","display":"lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence — Equivalence of Weak and Boolos Fixed Points","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence","aliases":["89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence — Equivalence of Weak and Boolos Fixed Points","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence — Equivalence of Weak and Boolos Fixed Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"251691cede4cbc3e\" href=\"?note=251691cede4cbc3e\" title=\"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness\">89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0b83ca065132609\" href=\"?note=a0b83ca065132609\" title=\"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point\">89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\">\\(p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为弱与加强不动点谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、107–108、122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>加强到弱：在加强等价中代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:=B\">\\(p:=B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow B)\">\\(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow B)\\)</span> 是定理，所以得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\">\\(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\\)</span>。\n弱到加强：选不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 中的全新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，在 Bernardi 引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow q\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow q\\)</span> 实例中代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:=B\">\\(q:=B\\)</span>。弱不动点方程和其必然化使第二个 dotted-box 前件成为定理，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow B)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow B)\\)</span>。Goldfarb 判据给加强等价。这里只保证同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-自由候选的两种性质等价；“无新增字母”是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}\\)</span> 的另一个条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","status":"resolved","id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B).","display":true},{"tex":"p:=B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow B)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow q","display":false},{"tex":"q:=B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow B)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}","display":false}],"bytes":1639,"backlinks":[{"id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d85c656be153752","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["85e306b51d3267ec","251691cede4cbc3e","a0b83ca065132609","fae50ce87c0c5e77","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}